    "CoiStatement": "Disclosure Kavita Gajria, Ernesto Aycardi, and Sanjay Gandhi are full-time employees of Teva Pharmaceuticals, which provided funding for the study. Lulu K Lee is a full-time employee of Kantar Health, which received funding from Teva Pharmaceuticals to conduct this study. Natalia M Flores was an employee of Kantar Health when this study was conducted. The authors report no other conflicts of interest in this work.",
